        {
          "text": "Saa ya kudzivugula, mmwenga watuluza mkpwono phondze, halafu mvyalusadzi achihala wuuzi wa kundu achimfunga mkpwononi na achiamba, “Hiyu ndiye chiyevyalwa na mbere.” ",
          "type": "text",
